# Source / build files — kept locally, not published
data/
build.py
DEPLOY.md
README.md
CLAUDE.md

# climate-plot build sources: the raw Climate Reanalyzer payload is already embedded
# in index.html, so publishing it again just re-hosts 118 kB of someone else's data.
# Template + verifier are local build tooling, same rule as build.py / data/.
climate-plot/sst_payload.json
climate-plot/sst_template.html
climate-plot/verify_render.py

# Belt-and-braces: data/ above already covers these, but they are the fields that must
# never reach a public commit, so name the files explicitly too.
**/profile.json
*.key
*.pem
.env
